    "description": "Excellent opportunity to acquire a pride-of-ownership, well maintained trophy triplex in San Francisco's sought after Nob Hill neighborhood. Solid rental history with upside provides great income and future potential for a traditional investor. Owner-occupier possibility and a good 1031 exchange option too! Three large 3 bedroom full-floor flats with in-unit laundry. Beautiful oak flooring throughout each unit with period details including box beam ceilings, built-in cabinets, wainscoting, and charm in abundance. Newer cabinetry and counters in kitchens. Bathrooms and kitchens have tiled floors for easy maintenance. Separate gas/electric meters. Roof replaced less than a year ago! Large, unused storage area on ground level - possible expansion potential? Easy access to Downtown and 96 Walk Score and 100 Transit Score!!"
